WEBVTT

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.800
You're really going for it, huh?

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.470
Where are you headed?

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.510
I'm following the eastern sea road to Tokyo.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.960
Wow, that's pretty impressive!

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.830
Good luck!

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.520
Thanks!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.490
Stitch, stitch...

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.860
Stitch, stitch...

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.360
What's with the stitching mantra?

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:01.950
If you stare at it so closely, you'll put your stitches in the wrong place, ya know?

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:02.450
Hm?

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.960
I really have...

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.130
Hey, Tsubomi! Have you finished it?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.130
I'm nearly done, but I just can't quite...

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.840
Why are you doing this at school, anyway?

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.200
Today's the day our classmate Hayashi reaches the end of his cycling journey,

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.760
so we're all going to head out to meet him!

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.450
The end of his cycling journey?

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:26.000
{OP}

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.190
HeartCatch

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:30.650
Precure!

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:34.230
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.200
Now, all together

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:42.710
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.330
Within each of our chests,

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.000
they begin to sprout

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.670
The seeds of the heart

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.920
are growing

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.550
bit by bit

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.220
Red,

00:01:59.220 --> 00:01:59.840
white

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.100
and yellow

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.890
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.350
all varied colors

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.800
that they

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.980
shine so brightly!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:14.320
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.820
with such care

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.530
will never wither

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.120
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.990
Now, all together

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:28.450
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.120
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.040
They're always right by our sides

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:36.870
So together

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.670
bloom even more!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.170
HeartCatch

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:46.680
Precure!

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.480
He's reaching the end of his journey?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.870
You see, in homeroom after the school's closing ceremonies...

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.470
My plan for the summer vacation

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.910
is to bicycle all the way from Kyoto to Tokyo!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.670
Come on, there's no way you can pull that off.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.620
Didn'tcha nearly kill yourself 
back in the spring marathon?{He just uses "wear yourself out", but that is such a shitty-sounding thing to accuse someone of in English.} {Yeah, this flows well. Good choice.}

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.630
Everyone, please.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:21.090
Jeez, if he says he's going to do it, then why be so harsh on him?!

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.010
Erika's right.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:28.640
Kyoto

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:28.640
Tokyo

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:28.640
m 232 253 l 263 315 l 382 275 l 363 208 m 918 436 l 1059 438 l 1053 504 l 918 499 

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:28.640
I hope you know the distance between 
Kyoto and Tokyo is about 500 kilometers.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.790
Just don't overdo it, all right?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.590
Right.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:35.480
I'm going to do this, no matter what!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.190
Wow, that's amazing.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.710
So he's reaching the end of his journey today, then?

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:43.530
That's right!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:49.880
When I heard that, I decided I was 
going to finish my dress all by myself!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:56.020
I should make a medal for
 Hayashi from the same material!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.250
A medal?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:01.260
A medal for accomplishing his summer goal!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.760
The Final Stretch of Summer<i>!</i>

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.760
The Final Stretch of Summer<i>!</i>

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.940
Somehow I managed to finish it in time.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.270
That's your medal?

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.150
Yep!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.690
Here he comes!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.920
You're amazing!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.250
You guys...

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.740
Welcome back, Hayashi!

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.690
Totally awesome!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.590
You really did it!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.580
Good work, dude!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.260
U-Um...

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.140
Please, take this. It's to celebrate your success!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.610
H-Here you go!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:48.580
Okay...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.300
It's a medal, apparently.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.600
Th-Thanks...

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.320
You're welcome!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.190
Hey, you took photos of the places you visited, right?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.700
Can I see them?!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:01.570
Sure.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.990
Whoa!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.990
Journey Map

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.740
This is where I started from, the Grand Sanjou Bridge.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.780
What's this castle?!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.950
That's Okazaki Castle.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.040
Hey, look at this!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.550
Oh, those are the eels I had in Hamamatsu!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.080
They look so good.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:18.630
Where's this?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:22.130
Takahashi B&B

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.130
That's taken in front of a bed and breakfast I stayed at.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.220
The breakfast there was so delicious.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.470
But man... this is seriously amazing.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:36.390
You achieved your goal for the 
summer with flying colors, Hayashi.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.860
Well, of course!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.580
I can't just sit around like this all day!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.720
Please excuse me, everyone!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.960
We'd better get going too, huh?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.740
Yeah.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.930
See you later, okay, Hayashi?

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:59.100
Huh? Hayashi, did you skin your knee?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.520
You're right! He did!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.790
There you go.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.330
Thanks.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:12.100
I'm glad you made it back in one piece.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:16.050
Come on, Ms. Tsurusaki! It was a piece of cake, really.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.190
Ms. Tsurusaki?

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:21.480
Tsubomi pricked her finger with a needle.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.980
Could you bandage it up for her?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.270
All right.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.940
Is something the matter?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.000
What's with your knee?

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.990
Oh, it's only a scratch!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.630
Hayashi, you really are great!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:38.460
I need to complete my goal for the summer too!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.920
What's your goal, Hanasaki?

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:46.210
To make my very own dress
 from a design I created myself!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:49.840
But, well, I just can't quite get the last bit right.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.900
I guess making a dress is harder than I thought it would be.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:58.520
If it's just a tiny bit left, why not get Kurumi to help you with it?

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:05.440
No! My goal is to finish it myself, and I'm 
going to see that through to the very end!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.070
That medal...

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:13.160
I made it from the same material I'm making my dress from.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:16.690
You've really given this your all, 
so I wanted to give you something.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:19.160
Though I guess it's kind of crappy.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.790
It's really not that bad.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.470
Ah!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.120
I messed it up again.

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:57.740
Now I'll have to start over.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.350
That part really is difficult, isn't it?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.250
Want me to do that bit for you?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.840
No, that's okay. Thanks, Erika.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.970
I just really want to do this myself!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.890
You can do it, Tsubomi!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.650
Thanks!

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:18.350
All right then! We'll stay here to watch over you!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.470
<i>Okay. Next stop is that telephone pole.</i>

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.710
Ow...

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.360
Hayashi?

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.200
Huh?!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.450
Are you all right?

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.120
Huh?!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.500
I don't want it!

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.230
I don't...

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.750
What's the matter, Tsubomi?

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.170
You must be Hayashi, right?

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:38.430
I was wondering if you'd mind giving a speech at the post-vacation assembly.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.620
I couldn't give a speech...

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.420
I'm sorry, but please, take it!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:42.970
Huh?!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.730
Hayashi!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:48.590
Did I say something I shouldn't have?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:51.830
Maybe he didn't like your medal.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:06.210
If one clears the mind, even fire
 itself can be made to cool the body.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:09.510
This chilling sensation is intoxicating!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.700
You whelps lack spirit!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.950
If you rouse your spirit, then this heat should not affect you in the slightest!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:25.440
I'll use this newfound spirit to beat those Precure to a pulp!

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.160
I see.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:49.620
Next question: what was the most memorable place you visited since leaving Kyoto?

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.540
I'm sorry, but I really have to go.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:04.680
Huh?!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.850
Wait, Hayashi!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:20.620
Well, well, don't you look troubled?

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:21.490
Who are you?!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:24.530
I am a Commander of the Desert Apostles,

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.190
Kumojacky.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.460
And I'll be taking the Flower of your Heart!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:34.330
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:46.490
You're up, Desertrian!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.830
Wow, that looks really adorable!

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:56.730
It doesh!

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:03.250
It feels so weird wearing something I made myself.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.110
It's really cute!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:08.120
You look fantastic!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.450
It really does suit you!

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.560
Do you really think so?

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.170
It really does!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.740
Come on, give us a twirl!

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:15.540
Huh?

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.010
Like this?

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.480
You're so cute!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:25.560
You did a great job finishing it all by yourself!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.940
I might've done it by myself, but I didn't do it alone!

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:32.190
I had you two cheering me on all the way!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.620
Cycle!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.320
Cycle!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.700
Hayashi's Flower of the Heart...

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.620
...is the one that was stolen!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.200
Hurry and transhform into Precuresh!

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:03.880
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.900
Precure!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.470
Open My Heart!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:59.000
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.170
Cure Blossom!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:09.860
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.190
Cure Marine!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:20.020
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.740
Cure Sunshine!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.320
HeartCatch Precure!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.820
Cycleclecleclecleclecle!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.610
I... I...

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.860
I didn't actually ride my bicycle the whole way there!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.260
I got off and took the bus instead!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.300
Huh?!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:13.300
I just couldn't bear to tell everyone that I'd given up halfway through.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:16.770
I just wanted everyone to admire me.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:20.060
So that's why you gave the medal back?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.410
Cleclecleclecle!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.840
Damn it! Just take them down already!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.210
Cycle!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.430
Sunshine!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.840
Your courage has been sealed away by the darkness.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.440
That darkness in your heart shall be illuminated by my light!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.200
Gather, Floral Power!

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:18.010
Shiny Tambourine!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.380
Flowers, dance for me!

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:40.740
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.940
Cycle...

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.150
Tch!

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:58.580
I'm such a loser, lying to everyone like this.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.910
How idiotic.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.250
If you're spineless enough to call yourself a loser,

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.460
then you are naught but a coward lacking in spirit!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.080
How utterly pathetic!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.410
Hayashi isn't pathetic at all!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:15.430
If he was, he wouldn't feel so 
ashamed to have lied like this!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.260
That's proof that he's earnest at heart!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.830
And now you're toying with Hayashi's heart.{+with}

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:26.980
I've had it up to here with this!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:38.490
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.690
Blossom Tact!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.610
Flowers, shine forth!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:18:00.320
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.920
It seems you have a lot of spirit, Cure Blossom!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:41.390
Are you all right?

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.540
Is that what you've been working on?

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.100
Yes! I finally finished it!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.620
It's really colorful, isn't it?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.570
Oh, no, I just thought you'd pick
 something a bit more subdued is all.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.640
I've always been very reserved, that's true.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:08.040
I didn't even really like speaking in class very much.

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:15.050
But I wanted to make something that would show a new me when I wore it.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.460
"A new me," huh?

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.760
I wish I had clothes that could do that.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.470
Hayashi?

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:27.770
You have your bicycle, don't you?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:41.880
I have to go back to school!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.870
I have to tell them what really happened.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.500
I've lied to you all.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:02.100
I-I didn't actually get past the mountain roads in Hakone.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.140
I stopped halfway through and took the bus instead!

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:06.430
Huh?!

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:10.060
I really didn't make it the whole way by bicycle.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.940
I'm sorry I lied to you all.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.400
What the heck, man?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:19.270
I really thought you were 
awesome for pulling it off too...

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:24.110
Getting from Kyoto to Hakone is pretty impressive in and of itself, you know?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.030
That doesn't change the fact that I lied to everyone.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.200
U-Um...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.770
Hayashi is still amazing!

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.530
After all, he had the courage to admit he lied to everyone!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:44.240
That's why...

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.290
Here.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:06.870
I'm going to try to climb the
 hills of Hakone one more time!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.410
And I'll use this bicycle to do it!

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:18.170
In the language of flowers, rapeseed
 blossoms mean "to be blessed with spirit."

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.840
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:38.590
With thish, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:23:00.020
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:09.030
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.170
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:27.310
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

